 to forget.", "char_start": 48, "char_end": 79}, {"session_id": "p000679-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Not great. People still aren't pulling their weight.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 52}, {"session_id": "p000679-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "They either ignore me or dismiss what I say.", "char_start": 51, "char_end": 95}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261012T174606Z", "last_updated_at": "20261012T175832Z", "first_seen_session": "p000679-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s1", "last_session": "p000679-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s3", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false, "sessions_seen": 3}
