{"node_id": "nd007", "text": "To feel appreciated", "depth": 2, "parent_id": "nd006", "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.6, "confidence_raw": 0.6, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000679-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "My sibling didn't pitch in with chores, and my coworker stole credit for my ideas.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 82}, {"session_id": "p000679-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "Makes me feel like my time and effort are worthless.", "char_start": 62, "char_end": 114}, {"session_id": "p000679-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "my coworker stole credit for my ideas. Feels like no one sees my efforts.", "char_start": 44, "char_end": 117}, {"session_id": "p000679-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s1", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "When I was younger, my parents hardly ever praised me for anything. Even now, it feels like no one notices. I just want to feel seen and appreciated for what I do.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 163}, {"session_id": "p000679-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s2", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "It's hard to find the right way. Everyone just expects me to solve everything. I just want to be appreciated for what I do.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 123}, {"session_id": "p000679-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Feels like no one values my efforts here.", "char_start": 72, "char_end": 113}, {"session_id": "p000679-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "It's not fair they don't acknowledge what I do. But they always seem to forget.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 79}, {"session_id": "p000679-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s3", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Everyone expects me to clean up after them. Feels like no one values my efforts here.", "char_start": 28, "char_end": 113}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261012T174802Z", "last_updated_at": "20261012T175832Z", "first_seen_session": "p000679-sft_calib_dec_ungated-s1", "last_session": "p000679-sft_calib_d